WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.180
Promoting your products in the Amazon store can help you increase visibility for new products, attract

00:00:08.180 --> 00:00:11.753
more customers, and manage overstock or seasonal items.

00:00:11.753 --> 00:00:14.880
Seller Central offers a range of promotional

00:00:14.880 --> 00:00:20.080
tools so you can choose the approach that works best for your products and business goals.

00:00:20.080 --> 00:00:25.600
There are four main types of promotions available to Amazon sellers, deals, price discounts,

00:00:25.600 --> 00:00:27.110
coupons, and promotions.

00:00:27.110 --> 00:00:31.640
Deals include best deals, lightning deals, and Amazon outlet,

00:00:31.640 --> 00:00:36.280
and they're a good option when you want high visibility placement or need to move overstock

00:00:36.280 --> 00:00:37.480
and seasonal inventory.

00:00:37.480 --> 00:00:41.880
Price discounts let you reduce the price directly on the listing

00:00:41.880 --> 00:00:46.426
so customers can see the savings before they add an item to their cart.

00:00:46.426 --> 00:00:47.400
Coupons work similarly

00:00:47.400 --> 00:00:52.520
appearing in search results and on product detail pages, where customers can clip and

00:00:52.520 --> 00:00:54.191
apply a discount at checkout.

00:00:54.191 --> 00:00:57.200
Promotions take a different approach, letting you create free

00:00:57.200 --> 00:00:59.920
offers like a percentage off or a buy one.

00:00:59.920 --> 00:01:02.640
Get one free deal to help increase sales volume

00:01:02.640 --> 00:01:05.160
or encourage customers to try a new product.

00:01:05.160 --> 00:01:07.680
In addition to the main promotion types, you

00:01:07.680 --> 00:01:14.280
can also utilize additional tools like prime exclusive deals and brand tailored promotions.

00:01:14.280 --> 00:01:19.520
Prime exclusive deals lets you offer exclusive pricing to prime members who actively engage

00:01:19.520 --> 00:01:23.637
with prime badged products and tend to make more repeat purchases.

00:01:23.637 --> 00:01:24.760
If you're enrolled

00:01:24.760 --> 00:01:30.520
in Amazon brand registry, brand tailored promotions lets you build personalized offers for specific

00:01:30.520 --> 00:01:35.280
customer audiences, such as repeat buyers or customers who have shown interest in your

00:01:35.280 --> 00:01:35.748
brand.

00:01:35.748 --> 00:01:41.360
Each promotion tool has different associated costs and eligibility requirements, so the

00:01:41.360 --> 00:01:44.096
right choice will depend on your products and goals.

00:01:44.096 --> 00:01:45.920
To learn more about choosing the

00:01:45.920 --> 00:01:51.640
right promotion for your needs, review which promotion is right for me in Seller University.
